ables, where \n\n$$\n{X}_{1}∼N({\\mu }_{1},{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}),\\,{X}_{2}∼N({\\mu }_{2},{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}),\\,{X}_{3}∼N({\\mu }_{3},{\\sigma }_{3}^{2}),\n$$\n\nthen \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Y & ={X}_{1}+{X}_{2}+{X}_{3} \\\\  & ∼N({\\mu }_{1}+{\\mu }_{2}+{\\mu }_{3},\\,{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}+{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}+{\\sigma }_{3}^{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{X}_{1}∼N(0,{3}^{2}),\\,{X}_{2}∼N(3,{2}^{2}),\\,{X}_{3}∼N(1,{2}^{2}),\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\nY={X}_{1}+{X}_{2}+{X}_{3}.\n$$\n\nSince ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},$ and ${X}_{3}$ are mutually independent, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[Y] & ={\\mu }_{1}+{\\mu }_{2}+{\\mu }_{3} \\\\  & =0+3+1 \\\\  & =4, \\\\ \\text{Var}[Y] & ={\\sigma }_{1}^{2}+{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}+{\\sigma }_{3}^{2} \\\\  & ={3}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{2}^{2} \\\\  & =9+4+4 \\\\  & =17.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Y={X}_{1}+{X}_{2}+{X}_{3} & ∼N(4,17).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-47a3d4eb-cdba-5f52-b2b1-08d4c2047e6b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-47a3d4eb-cdba-5f52-b2b1-08d4c2047e6b" :answer-field/id #uuid "47a3d4eb-cdba-5f52-b2b1-08d4c2047e6b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-5c00e6bb-ddca-55aa-a866-4cd890a056f4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e992c997-2922-5820-9d5e-74f6e6a932e6" "answer-5c00e6bb-ddca-55aa-a866-4cd890a056f4" "answer-5b8f4921-8cd9-5ac3-9184-bc2537f7536b" "answer-69f40d1c-121e-5f5f-a767-0262dc6b1cb9" "answer-593f72c7-c6f8-5884-8eb4-d44bfef4503e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e992c997-2922-5820-9d5e-74f6e6a932e6" :answer/id #uuid "e992c997-2922-5820-9d5e-74f6e6a932e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Y∼N(2,7)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5c00e6bb-ddca-55aa-a866-4cd890a056f4" :answer/id #uuid "5c00e6bb-ddca-55aa-a866-4cd890a056f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Y∼