:question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-60af626e-3ef7-5d7c-96e7-7dc36bbcb60d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-60af626e-3ef7-5d7c-96e7-7dc36bbcb60d" :answer-field/id #uuid "60af626e-3ef7-5d7c-96e7-7dc36bbcb60d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c2dfca87-64c7-5892-a5e2-c989f947aac3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-360cd63a-5942-576e-984b-d880c6a49efa" "answer-c2dfca87-64c7-5892-a5e2-c989f947aac3" "answer-c4294185-d9a4-51c5-b464-dd49e730abc2" "answer-29e2ab2a-41df-5082-adcc-efb6a5b40d89" "answer-e780bf2e-ab38-5d2a-a1d1-85bffcb47824"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-360cd63a-5942-576e-984b-d880c6a49efa" :answer/id #uuid "360cd63a-5942-576e-984b-d880c6a49efa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Y∼N(2,21)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c2dfca87-64c7-5892-a5e2-c989f947aac3" :answer/id #uuid "c2dfca87-64c7-5892-a5e2-c989f947aac3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Y∼N(2,7)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c4294185-d9a4-51c5-b464-dd49e730abc2" :answer/id #uuid "c4294185-d9a4-51c5-b464-dd49e730abc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Y∼N(30,21)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-29e2ab2a-41df-5082-adcc-efb6a5b40d89" :answer/id #uuid "29e2ab2a-41df-5082-adcc-efb6a5b40d89" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Y∼N(30,7)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e780bf2e-ab38-5d2a-a1d1-85bffcb47824" :answer/id #uuid "e780bf2e-ab38-5d2a-a1d1-85bffcb47824" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Y∼N(8,7)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-2c34156c-74ee-5271-a0cf-be78f0930f45" :question/id #uuid "2c34156c-74ee-5271-a0cf-be78f0930f45" :question/math-academy-id "q-142960" :question/problem "Given that the random variables \n\n$$\n{X}_{1}∼N(-1,3),\\,{X}_{2}∼N(3,2),\\,{X}_{3}∼N(1,1)\n$$\n\nare mutually independent, what is the distribution of $Y=3{X}_{1}-4{X}_{2}-2{X}_{3}?$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that if ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},$ and ${X}_{3}$ are mutually independent random variables, where \n\n$$\n{X}_{1}∼N({\\mu }_{1},{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}),\\,{X}_{2}∼N({\\mu }_{2},{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}),\\,{X}_{3}∼N({\\mu }_{3},{\\sigma }_{3}^{2}),\n$$\n\nand ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}$ are real constants,  then \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Y & ={a}_{1}{X}_{1}+{a}_{2}{X}_{2}+{a}_{3}{X}_{3} \\\\  & ∼N({a}_{1}{\\mu }_{1}+{a}_{2}{\\mu }_{2}+{a}_{3}{\\mu }_{3},\\,{a}_{1}^{2}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}+{a}_{2}^{2}{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}+{a}_{3}^{2}{\\sigma }_{3}^{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{X}_{1}∼N(-1,3),\\,{X}_{2}∼N(3,2),\\,{X}_{3}∼N(1,1),\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\nY=3{X}_{1}-4{X}_{2}-2{X}_{3}.\n$$\n\nSince ${X}_{1},{X}_{2},$ and ${X}_{3}$ are mutually independent, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[Y] & ={a}_{1}{\\mu }_{1}+{a}_{2}{\\mu }_{2}+{a}_{3}{\\mu }_{3} \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-1)+(-4)\\cdot 3+(-2)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-3-12-2 \\\\  & =-17, \\\\ \\text{Var}[Y] & ={a}_{1}^{2}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}+{a}_{2}^{2}{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}+{a}_{3}^{2}{\\sigma }_{3}^{2} \\\\  & ={3}^{2}\\cdot 3+(-4)^{2}\\cdot 2+(-2)^{2}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =9\\cdot 3+16\\cdot 2+4\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =27+32+4 \\\\  & =63.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Y=3{X}_{1}-4{X}_{2}-2{X}_{3} & ∼N(-17,63).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-16afd0ce-a98f-530b-911d-c450c3840e38"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-16afd0ce-a98f-530b-911d-c450c3840e38" :answer-field/id #uuid "16afd0ce-a98f-530b-911d-c450c3840e38" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-79000fb7-d06e-5652-809c-f7f34696bbc1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-79000fb7-d06e-5652-809c-f7f34696bbc1" "answer-e4092a08-b349-5868-a4b8-ac5c8ab3822b" "answer-cbb76f7c-1e75-5447-b76e-48e20881bac4" "answer-b14b4edc-baf7-5887-88bc-9a8e12efa3f4"